--// Cut Up Any Clothing, The List
--// aspctt - 23.08.2026
--// Generated by tools/generate_cut_clothing.py, do not edit by hand.
--//
--// Every garment qolc_cut_clothing.txt made cuttable, which is the only thing the
--// sandbox switch needs to know: with the feature off these go back to being
--// uncuttable and everything vanilla already allowed carries on untouched.
--//
--// A list rather than a tag test. Both halves carry vanilla's rip tags and reading
--// one back would be tidier, but InventoryItem.hasTag takes ItemTag objects rather
--// than strings and there is no route to one from lua. Written by the same pass that
--// writes the script, so the two cannot disagree.
--//
--// Shared, because the recipe is tested by whichever side is in charge.

-- Wallets are in the table below as well, so the switch covers them, but they are
-- not clothing and are cut by a recipe of their own. Kept here separately so anything
-- reasoning about the clothing recipes can leave them out.
